(5164548, 752214, 96924, '<td valign="top">This is "Clever", but won''t cut it. The whole excersize is to see who can handle the lighting, exposure and timing of the fireworks the best. The combination of the different elements make it quite a challenge. To photgraph a flower is an opt-out of the real issues at play in this challenge.</td>', 'This is "Clever", but won''t cut it. The whole excersize is to see who can handle the lighting, exposure and timing of the fireworks the best. The combination of the different elements make it quite a challenge. To photgraph a flower is an opt-out of the real issues at play in this challenge.', '2009-01-02 03:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5164549, 752081, 96924, '<td valign="top">The whole excersize is to see who can handle the lighting, exposure and timing of the fireworks the best. The combination of the different elements make it quite a challenge. This photgraph to me seems like an opt-out of the real issues at play in this challenge.</td>', 'The whole excersize is to see who can handle the lighting, exposure and timing of the fireworks the best. The combination of the different elements make it quite a challenge. This photgraph to me seems like an opt-out of the real issues at play in this challenge.', '2009-01-02 03:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
