(5166175, 752222, 88136, '<td valign="top">woooooow. i was shocked when this popped up, i wasn''t expecting such an awesome photo. the feathers of the fireworks are beautiful. the smokey lights in the sky are gorgeous, great job capturing them as well as you did. the silhouettes of the trees are a great touch too. all in all a very impressive photo in my book:)</td>', 'woooooow. i was shocked when this popped up, i wasn''t expecting such an awesome photo. the feathers of the fireworks are beautiful. the smokey lights in the sky are gorgeous, great job capturing them as well as you did. the silhouettes of the trees are a great touch too. all in all a very impressive photo in my book:)', '2009-01-02 21:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5166185, 752159, 88136, '<td valign="top">this photo has been growing on me more ever second i look at it. my first reaction was an unpleasent one(not sure why), but them i kept looking and it became a very interesting peice. i love how unique each of the explosions are, in both color and shape. i originally didnt like the houses with their glowing windows, but now they really grab me. the silhouettes of the roofs and the different tones of glow and designs in the windows are very intersting once you really start looking. same with the street lights and the line of lights off on the horizon.</td>', 'this photo has been growing on me more ever second i look at it. my first reaction was an unpleasent one(not sure why), but them i kept looking and it became a very interesting peice. i love how unique each of the explosions are, in both color and shape. i originally didnt like the houses with their glowing windows, but now they really grab me. the silhouettes of the roofs and the different tones of glow and designs in the windows are very intersting once you really start looking. same with the street lights and the line of lights off on the horizon.', '2009-01-02 21:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
